A||||10||Dan86gt3.8||1/4 mile times for a stock 3.8/on auto 4 speed||||9||
Z||000000||Dan86gt3.8||09-30-2000||05:08 PM||||well I finally visited teh track  I went to river city raceway in marion texas (right outside of San Antonio)(www.rivercityracewayinc.com).<BR>Well I ran it in stock form drove striaght in went to tech let it cool down for about 5 minutes while I went to the bathroom.  Took it out and ran it 3 times and found out I have a bracket racer on my hands. well here goes:<BR>reaction-------.8199<BR>60ft-----------2.3414<BR>330------------6.4499<BR>1/8et----------9.8928<BR>1/8 mph--------71.54<BR>1000et---------12.8427<BR>1000mph--------none<BR>1/4et----------15.3369<BR>1/4mph---------90.23<P>Well i raced5 times I only lost once.  My first 2 were a new dodge ram.  then I raced a 3rd gen iroc camaro (must have ben a 305).  My 4th race was against a 3rd gen that had tires stickin a foot out of the wheel wells.  He ran a 13 flat so I wasn't upset on that one. then I raced (69 maybe)fast back mustang that sounded like it was going to run a damn 12 or 11 and got  up there and was behind me the whole time.  He rana 16.3.<P>Well I was somewhat unhappy I was thinking I was going to run a 15 or some high 14's.  I poped the screen out of my throttle body for my last 2 runs but it did not help me any and made it iddle funny.  I did not take anything out of the car, my subs spare tire or anything like that.  Did not screw with tire pressure. it was on lowest grade poor college kid gas.  Ohh and probably not the smartest thing I have ever done but the cv boot had slipped off (have not had this happen sinse june when we thought we fixed it for good, but I decide to finally take my ass to the track and it comes off on the way up there)  Overall I was happy that I one all my races but ws not happy with my times.<BR>So in reacap 4 15.3's and one 15.4.  <P>Dan Fischer<BR>Waco/san marcos, TEXAS! <P>------------------<BR>86 gt fiero<BR>3.8/4speed auto<BR>ace conversion kit<BR>15" konig monsoon's<BR>rear swaybar/ and urethane on rear.<BR>Soon to come urethane all the way around. and new yellow paint w/ raised spoiler!!!!<BR>(also in way future years forced induction on my 3.8!!!!!!!!!)||||reg||9
